{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24693","headline":"和李相公留守题漕上新桥六韵 · 白居易","name":"和李相公留守题漕上新桥六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"选石铺新路，安桥压古堤。\n似从银汉下，落傍玉川西。\n影定栏杆倒，标高华表齐。\n烟开虹半见，月冷鹤双栖。\n材映夔龙小，功嫌元凯低。\n从容济世後，余力及黔黎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}